<title>MEXICO: Femsa to pay 0.13 peso/shr dividend.</title>
<headline>Femsa to pay 0.13 peso/shr dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Mexican bottler Fomento Economico Mexicano (Femsa) said Tuesday they agreed to pay a dividend of 0.13 peso per share, payable June 1.</p>
<p>Femsa was holding its annual general meeting here in this northern Mexico city where the company is based. Shareholders added the dividend will be payable against coupon number eight and made in a one-time payment.</p>
<p>Directors of the company told shareholders that the dividend payment would amount to 70 million pesos.</p>
<p>((Jacqueline Lerma, Monterrey bureau +528 345-7677))</p>
